  "description": "Captain Kyle is a man of the people. He works hard to help merchants secure fair prices and, most importantly, he hates people who value money over mankind. People just like the Roches… So, when the Roche household starts searching for a new servant, Kyle sees an oh-so-appetizing opportunity: the chance to sneak behind enemy lines and prove that the Roches are rotten to the core. But in between inter-family feuding and painfully obvious political plots, Kyle unearths a bigger mystery: the eldest son refuses to eat. Determined to get to the bottom of the Roche family's decay, Kyle takes it upon himself to solve this particular conundrum. However, it soon turns out that food might not be the only appetite that begins to stir… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
